lue_text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Brown","value_text":"Brown","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","value_text":"\"Memory Lane\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]}],"start":0,"end":192}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Unnamed Suit 042 accompanied [[Rassimov]] and [[The Professor]] in [[King Solomon's mines]] to retrieve the ring of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was defeated along the other Suits. {{Source|S1E23}}","text":"Unnamed Suit 042 accompanied Rassimov and The Professor in King Solomon's mines to retrieve the ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked Ammit Heart-Eater but was defeated along the other Suits. [S1E23]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Boltflare]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost\n* Boltflare"},{"heading":"Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Sekhmet]]\n\n{{col-end}}","text":"* Ammit Heart-Eater\n* Bonelasher\n* Enforcer\n* Redcap\n* Sekhmet"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* He has a Russian accent.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"* He has a Russian accent."}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 042 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by Rassimov.\n\n== History ==\nUnnamed Suit 042 accompanied Rassimov and The Professor in King Solomon's mines to retrieve the ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked Ammit Heart-Eater but was defeated along the other Suits. [S1E23]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n=== Spells ===\n* Augerfrost\n* Boltflare\n\n=== Titans ===\n* Ammit Heart-Eater\n* Bonelasher\n* Enforcer\n* Redcap\n* Sekhmet\n\n==Trivia==\n* He has a Russian accent.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 042.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Brown\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[Memory Lane]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 042''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[Rassimov]].\n\n== History ==\nUnnamed Suit 042 accompanied [[Rassimov]] and [[The Professor]] in [[King Solomon's mines]] to retrieve the ring of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was defeated along the other Suits. {{Source|S1E23}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Boltflare]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Titans ===\n* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Sekhmet]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* He has a Russian accent.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"King Solomon's mines","label":"King Solomon's mines","target_id":"huntik:page:19331","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/King_Solomon%27s_mines","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19331"},{"target_title":"Tao","label":"Tao","target_id":"huntik:page:2421","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tao","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2421"},{"target_title":"Ammit Heart-Eater","label":"Ammit Heart-Eater","target_id":"huntik:page:3356","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ammit_Heart-Eater","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3356"},{"target_title":"Augerfrost","label":"Augerfrost","target_id":"huntik:page:2005","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Augerfrost","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2005"},{"target_title":"Boltflare","label":